Gesture Mouse Controller Started!

Gestures:
- Index finger up: Move cursor
- Index + Thumb up: Left Click
- Two fingers up (Index + Middle): Right Click
- Three fingers up (Index + Middle + Ring): Double Click
- Four fingers up: Scroll (Upper box = Up, Lower box = Down)
- Thumbs Up: Volume increase
- Thumbs Down: Volume decrease

Press 'q' to quit
